{
  "_comment": "R4-5 new-api 网关四宫格面板。导入方式：Grafana UI → Dashboards → Import → 上传本文件并选择 Prometheus 数据源；或将本目录作为 provisioning 源挂载到 grafana 容器 /etc/grafana/provisioning/dashboards 并配置 provider 后自动加载。所有 PromQL 均逐字取自 deploy/newapi/prometheus-rules.yml 与 deploy/agenthub_rules.yml 中真实存在的告警表达式，未发明任何指标。",
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus",
      "description": "",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "__requires": [],
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "_comment": "宫格①：网关可用性。up{job=\"new-api\"} 来自 agenthub_rules.yml 的 NewAPIProbeDown；probe_success{job=\"new-api\"} 来自 deploy/newapi/prometheus-rules.yml 的探活口径（blackbox 探测 /api/status）。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": { "color": "red", "index": 1, "text": "DOWN" },
                "1": { "color": "green", "index": 0, "text": "UP" }
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "up{job=\"new-api\"}",
          "legendFormat": "up (prometheus 抓取)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "probe_success{job=\"new-api\"}",
          "legendFormat": "probe_success (/api/status)",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "网关可用性 up",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "宫格②：渠道成功率与 5xx 率。表达式逐字对齐 agenthub_rules.yml / prometheus-rules.yml 中 NewAPI5xxRateHigh 与 NewAPIErrorRateHigh（仅去掉阈值比较），成功率为错误率的补数。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "max": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(relay_requests_total{status=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(relay_requests_total[5m])), 1e-6)",
          "legendFormat": "5xx 率 (NewAPI5xxRateHigh 口径)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(relay_requests_total{status=~\"4..|5..\"}[10m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(relay_requests_total[10m])), 1e-6)",
          "legendFormat": "4xx+5xx 错误率 (NewAPIErrorRateHigh 口径)",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "1 - (sum(rate(relay_requests_total{status=~\"4..|5..\"}[10m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(relay_requests_total[10m])), 1e-6))",
          "legendFormat": "成功率",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "title": "渠道成功率与 5xx 率",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "宫格③：p95 转发延迟。表达式逐字对齐 prometheus-rules.yml 的 NewAPILatencySLO；红色阈值线 2s 即该告警的 SLO 边界。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 2 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "sort": "none" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(relay_request_duration_seconds_bucket[10m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "转发 p95 延迟 (NewAPILatencySLO 口径)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "p95 转发延迟（SLO 2s）",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "宫格④：日 token 用量（Prometheus 口径二选一）。指标来自 agenthub_rules.yml P3 TokenUsageApproachingLimit 引用的真实计数器；与导出 sidecar 的 ./data/newapi-export/<YYYY-MM-DD>.json 可交叉对账。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 40,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 9 },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["sum"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "sort": "none" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
          "expr": "sum(increase(quota_usage_events_total{event_type=\"token_consumed\"}[24h]))",
          "legendFormat": "近 24h token 消耗事件",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "日 token 用量（Prometheus 口径）",
      "type": "timeseries"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "5m",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["new-api", "gateway", "agenthub"],
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "time": { "from": "now-24h", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "new-api 网关总览（R4-5 四宫格）",
  "uid": "newapi-gateway-r45",
  "version": 1,
  "weekStart": ""
}
